{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "93119790-fb96-84fe-96a6-aa1faefdd25b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T16:01:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:58:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Beth. Leo Pellegrino. I'm calling about the scholarship for class fees. Heard you have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do, yes. We have a fee assistance program for residents, covers a lot of the youth and adult classes. Which class are you looking at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Swim lessons for my daughter. Spring session, I think it starts end of March."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. Spring swim, that's one a lot of families ask about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's the cost? For the scholarship, I mean. Is there a charge to apply?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no charge to apply. The application's free. And what you'd pay for the class itself depends on your household's situation, so it's reduced instead of one flat number. They look at it once the form is in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So no fee for the form. Just the class cost after, reduced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T15:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. And the swim session itself has a listed price in the program guide, so you'd see the full amount first and then what the assistance takes off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Where do I get the form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pick one up at the front desk here, or I can email it to you. Which is easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Email's fine. Hold on, [pause] I'm in the truck, let me pull over. Sorry, a neighbor left a note on my door. I haven't read it yet. It's on the seat here. Anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, take your time. Do you want to give me the email address you'd like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Actually, can you just mail it? Easier. I'll give you the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can mail it. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, I don't want to say it on the phone, cell's bad here anyway. I'll just stop by the desk. You open tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:00:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We are, we're open tomorrow morning at eight-thirty and we're here until five. Just ask for me or whoever's at the front desk and they'll hand you the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Eight-thirty. Anything I need to bring with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Something showing you live in Newport, like a utility bill or a license. And if you have last year's tax return or a benefits letter, bring that too, it speeds things up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utility bill, tax return. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And the spring registration's open now, so if you want a spot in the swim class, don't wait too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll come tomorrow. Thanks, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Leo. Have a good evening!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T16:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
